0..80 Comment "//! η for products and records: a pair is the pair of its own projections and a"
81..161 Comment "//! record the record of its own fields, as a function is the abstraction of its"
162..241 Comment "//! own application [MartinLof-1984-intuitionistic_type_theory]. A neutral at a"
242..312 Comment "//! product, a record or a dependent pair converts to the tuple of its"
313..391 Comment "//! projections on either side, so reflexivity at the neutral proves the path."
392..395 Comment "//!"
396..452 Comment "//! - cites: [MartinLof-1984-intuitionistic_type_theory]"
453..456 Comment "//!"
457..629 Comment "//! [MartinLof-1984-intuitionistic_type_theory]: https://archive-pml.github.io/martin-lof/pdfs/Bibliopolis-Book-retypeset-1984.pdf \"Martin-Löf, Intuitionistic Type Theory\""
